From: EglantinePS5 <noreply@eglantineps5.local>
Subject: [PATCH] Migrate 0311-fog-02-land-clears-before-copies.patch

Source: 0311-fog-02-land-clears-before-copies.patch
Core patch, for tools/eglantine-patches as 0191.

Port of zortos293/Lichii PR 185 (vouion, 99c5b39c9e, open there). A deferred clear
waits for its framebuffer's next render pass, but copies bypass render passes, so
a clear parked before a blit landed after it and wiped it. Ocarina's terrain layer
read that wiped depth (Lichii issue 101). BlitImage, CopyImage and PrepareDmaImage
now realize a parked clear first.

Switch: EDEN_NX2_CLEAR_BEFORE_COPY=1, ours; the source has none. Default off. The
layer that showed it is a mesh draw, which EDEN_NX2_NO_MESH skips here, so expect
no change on the console until mesh draws run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
